
# Expense Attendance Grading and Billing System

## About the Project
This is a simple Python-based CLI project
that manages student expenses, attendance,
grading and billing.

## Features
- Student Registration
- Unique Roll Number
- Expense Management
- Attendance Management
- Student Grading System
- Billing Management
- Student Reports
- Attendance Summary

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Dictionary
- Functions
- Loops
- Conditional Statements
- Exception Handling
- Map Function

## Project Files
- main.py
- validators.py
- expenses.py
- attendance.py
- grading.py
- billing.py
- reports.py

## How to Run
1. Install Python.
2. Open the project folder.
3. Run main.py.

## Project Type
Command Line Interface (CLI)
